rts success only for exit code 0, and reports nonzero/timeout outcomes as failed. On a second SIGINT/SIGTERM it exits while in-flight commands continue; the source states their leases expire and their runs are retried. [Sources: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/croffasia/itsaplan/v1.5.0/packages/runner/src/cli.ts ; https://raw.githubusercontent.com/croffasia/itsaplan/main/packages/runner/src/execute.ts]\\\\n- The v1.5.0 release notes explicitly say a run that reaches a time or step limit ends failed without retry, and the runner exposes its effective timeout to the command as . [Source: https://api.github.com/repos/croffasia/itsaplan/releases/tags/v1.5.0]\\\\n\\\\n### Ecosystem and Compatibility\\\\n\\\\n- Official runner documentation defines a local/remote boundary: the runner runs on the operator machine, polls an Itsaplan instance, and starts the selected coding-agent CLI in configured ; the runner itself does not create a worktree or branch. Its documented configuration has , /, , AGENT=1\\nANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN=sk-bf-c3b506e2-6555-430f-9fa9-b7d7ac7a146b\\nARTIFACTORY_AU_HOST=artifactory.au.shield.ai\\nARTIFACTORY_AU_TOKEN=cmVmdGtuOjAxOjAwMDAwMDAwMDA6a3FqQUN6RDl6WUxUY3puZnlLRFhCYklIODhH\\nARTIFACTORY_AU_TOKEN_FULL=eyJ2ZXIiOiIyIiwidHlwIjoiSldUIiwiYWxnIjoiUlMyNTYiLCJraWQiOiJqUlJTbGluaUtrNzEzV3F1eUZBbmRsRjA0d2dZdDljUC01RzNrR19hdXBjIn0..IQveLwcCHrdUMRdOWPs6yd_OtuF-naolgY70v1DE9RymAx3nOQH6U_1dzKBN0MPsmO-d0_FhiX806M0rb24U2QOfXDxM9PZ7mdK3ukEOyVk8tW02hgmNwhPolsBE5o1QZjEk3Lw53zu0SPHXTffDdJ27BDgRdONeEJE8qimQEaLu_SRAjg1oo0Gg-DVjWM7kQXgjnqTlSMI3ZxMZEgxsy8cIXEj_ylLsdLfLvuhH03Cnywd3Vo6VQGQH-uHGMTJeRt-gWqB_W2EIJbBiac4Re8n_m4ZA0yBXQ4JCrVytb3lxeJ_m0LtWzZAwarBjGbecbRHGESSqMWvpkGnM9KmGOA\\nARTIFACTORY_AU_USER=jamie.nelson@shield.ai\\nAWS_PAGER=\\nAZURE_DEVOPS_EXT_PAT=DCmCoO3LPm8DTdkOi7u4OlJ3BEyhKq1alfh2WpfUk2nVQ032UGqnJQQJ99CIACAAAAAksTyfAAASAZDOL1CV\\nBAT_PAGER=cat\\nBIFROST_API_KEY=sk-bf-c3b506e2-6555-430f-9fa9-b7d7ac7a146b\\nBIFROST_HOST=bifrost.shield.ai\\nBUN_INSTALL=/home/j